Now my elder brother comes in front of the camera.
His name is Diego.
He sits next to Sofia.
Diego smiles and says, "Hello, Maya!"
"How are you?"
I say, "I am fine, Diego."
He asks, "How is your new job?"
I answer happily, "My job is very good."
"My office is big and beautiful."
"The people there are very nice."
"Rohan helps me a lot."
Diego asks, "Who is Rohan?"
I tell him, "He works in my software company."
"He is a colleague."
"He is a good friend of mine."
Diego looks happy.
He says, "This is a very good thing."
